  "name": "SPANE Standard Scoring",
  "status": "validated",
  "description": "Scale of Positive and Negative Experience (Diener et al., 2010). Two 6-item subscale sums (each item 1-5, range 6-30): SPANE-P (positive feelings: items 1,3,5,7,10,12) and SPANE-N (negative feelings: items 2,4,6,8,9,11). An affect-balance score is SPANE-P minus SPANE-N (range -24 to +24).",
  "publication": {
    "citation": "Diener E, Wirtz D, Tov W, Kim-Prieto C, Choi D, Oishi S, Biswas-Diener R (2010). New well-being measures: short scales to assess flourishing and positive and negative feelings. Soc Indic Res, 97, 143-156.",
    "year": 2010
  },
